<title>ITALY: SOCCER-SAMPDORIA'S LAIGLE HAS NOSE OPERATION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SAMPDORIA'S LAIGLE HAS NOSE OPERATION.</headline>
<dateline>GENOA, Italy 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sampdoria's new French signing Pierre Laigle had surgery on Monday for a broken nose and is expected to be sidelined for three weeks.</p>
<p>The international midfielder, who moved from French club Lens this season on a four-year contract, fractured his nose on Saturday during Sampdoria's 4-1 serie A away win over Roma.</p>
